 179: # Allow/disallow testing manual linking of accounts
 180: #
 181: # REQ-001 AT-001.04 â€” FLIPPED FROM THE TEMPLATE'S false, and this line is the subject of the
 182: # criterion rather than a convenience. "Given a visitor completing volunteer signup by email or
 183: # Google (no GitHub identity yet) â€¦ linking completes signup": that link is Auth's `linkIdentity`
 184: # call, and GoTrue REFUSES it outright while this flag is false. With the flag false the flow the
 185: # criterion describes could not exist at all.
