 124: // BOTH shipped GitHub judgements, not one. The IMPORT SOURCE is the shipped stub, not a copy living
 125: // in this file â€” AT-001.05 compares the profile it reads back against `stubGithubStatsFor`, so if the
 126: // two were separate implementations the test would grade the fixture's copy and say nothing about
 127: // what the edge function writes. And `extractGithubHandle` is the OTHER shipped decision on this
 128: // path: `completeSignup` below derives the caller fact through it rather than reading the stored
